      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 FL2VA: 1024x512 / 56 frames / 24 fps / seed 42 / 20 res_multistep-simple steps. Periodic longitude RoPE blend 1 (not full spherical latitude encoding), native dual-rotation decode blend 4. Native INT8 encoder. No post-decode upscaler. Wrap passed seeds 42/43.\nNo panorama LoRA, rolling or wrapped noise. Exports come directly from the selected wrap-aware decoder. Keep full 2:1 ERP framing. Longitude-wrap qualification does not establish pole quality, subject identity or camera-path accuracy. See example_workflows/README.md."
